Track: R Package PDF Manual and Vignette Publication Quality Gate

Summary:
- Added CRAN-style R PDF manual generation gates in CI and binding publication workflows with TinyTeX setup and versioned artifacts.
- Completed R Rd coverage with package-level documentation and static exported-alias tests.
- Added a buildable, network-free R vignette with live kernel calls guarded by INNOVATE_R_VIGNETTE_RUN_KERNEL.
- Added R metadata for vignette builds, artifact exclusion policy, CRAN comments, and release docs.
- Recorded six-agent ownership and standards audit notes in the Conductor track.

Validation:
- uv run pytest tests/unit/test_r_package_pdf_manual.py tests/unit/test_binding_publication_ci.py tests/unit/test_conductor_workflow_docs.py tests/unit/test_prose_lint_docs.py -q
- uv run ruff check . && uv run ruff format --check .
- Rscript tools::checkRd over bindings/r/man/*.Rd
- R CMD build bindings/r --no-manual
- R CMD Rd2pdf --no-preview --output=/tmp/innovate.R_manual_check.pdf bindings/r
- R CMD check --as-cran --no-manual innovate.R_0.5.0.tar.gz
- uv run python -m sphinx -b html docs/source /tmp/innovate-docs-r-manual-track

